---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="BNDY Workboard | What we are building"
  description="Live visual backlog of the BNDY product, data, ingestion and intelligence workstreams."
  path="/workboard"
>
  <section class="wb-shell">
    <header class="wb-hero">
      <div>
        <div class="wb-kicker">BNDY / OPERATING VIEW</div>
        <h1>One board.<br /><span>Every moving part.</span></h1>
        <p class="wb-lede">What is live now, what is actively being built, the target state we are aiming at, and what comes after.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="wb-hero-actions">
        <a class="wb-btn wb-btn-primary" href="/workboard.json" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View structured JSON</a>
        <a class="wb-btn" href="https://github.com/flowency-live/bndy-website/blob/main/WORKBOARD.md" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Agent update rules</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="wb-summary" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="wb-summary-card"><strong id="wbLaneCount">-</strong><span>workstreams</span></div>
      <div class="wb-summary-card"><strong id="wbProdRepoCount">-</strong><span>production repos</span></div>
      <div class="wb-summary-card wb-summary-risk"><strong id="wbRiskCount">-</strong><span>needs attention</span></div>
      <div class="wb-summary-card"><strong id="wbUpdated">-</strong><span>board updated</span></div>
    </div>

    <section class="wb-architecture">
      <div class="wb-section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="wb-kicker">THE CONVERGENCE RULE</div>
          <div class="wb-title-line">
            <h2>How new information should enter BNDY</h2>
            <span class="wb-stamp wb-stamp-target">TARGET STATE</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="wb-flow" aria-label="Target BNDY data flow">
        <div class="wb-flow-node">Transport<span>Android · Web · WhatsApp · Messenger</span></div>
        <div class="wb-flow-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="wb-flow-node">Capture<span>durable intake + evidence</span></div>
        <div class="wb-flow-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="wb-flow-node wb-flow-focus">Enrichment<span>extract · interpret · claims</span></div>
        <div class="wb-flow-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="wb-flow-node wb-flow-focus">Projection<span>authority + dedupe policy</span></div>
        <div class="wb-flow-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="wb-flow-node">Canonical BNDY<span>artists · venues · gigs · festivals</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="wb-alert">
        <strong>Not all the way there yet.</strong>
        <span>Some assisted and Capture flows already use Enrichment for resolution, but still call canonical creation directly. The durable claims + projection route is being built into the shared authoritative path.</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wb-section">
      <div class="wb-section-head wb-workstream-head">
        <div>
          <div class="wb-kicker">KANBAN / SWIMLANES</div>
          <h2>Workstreams</h2>
          <div class="wb-legend" aria-label="Workstream state legend">
            <span class="wb-stamp wb-state-live">LIVE</span><span class="wb-legend-copy">working today</span>
            <span class="wb-stamp wb-state-building">BUILDING</span><span class="wb-legend-copy">active change</span>
            <span class="wb-stamp wb-state-planned">PLANNED</span><span class="wb-legend-copy">backlog</span>
            <span class="wb-stamp wb-stamp-target">TARGET STATE</span><span class="wb-legend-copy">future architecture/capability</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="wb-tools">
          <input id="wbSearch" class="wb-search" type="search" placeholder="Filter streams, repos or work..." aria-label="Filter workboard" />
          <button id="wbClear" class="wb-btn wb-btn-small" type="button">Clear</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="wb-viewbar" aria-label="Board view controls">
        <div class="wb-viewbar-group">
          <span>Swimlanes</span>
          <button id="wbExpandLanes" class="wb-view-btn" type="button">Expand all</button>
          <button id="wbCollapseLanes" class="wb-view-btn" type="button">Collapse all</button>
          <button id="wbFocusNow" class="wb-view-btn wb-view-btn-focus" type="button">NOW across all</button>
        </div>
        <div class="wb-viewbar-group">
          <span>Columns</span>
          <button class="wb-view-btn wb-col-global" data-column="now" type="button">NOW</button>
          <button class="wb-view-btn wb-col-global" data-column="next" type="button">TODO</button>
          <button class="wb-view-btn wb-col-global" data-column="done" type="button">DONE</button>
          <button id="wbResetView" class="wb-view-btn" type="button">Reset view</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="wbBoard" class="wb-board">
        <div class="wb-loading">Loading workboard…</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wb-section">
      <div class="wb-section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="wb-kicker">REPOSITORY MAP</div>
          <h2>What each codebase actually serves</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="wbRepos" class="wb-repos"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="wb-section wb-activity-section">
      <div class="wb-section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="wb-kicker">LIVE GITHUB SIGNAL</div>
          <h2>Recent commits & open PRs</h2>
          <p class="wb-muted">Pulled directly from public GitHub when you open this page. The backlog itself remains the structured JSON above.</p>
        </div>
        <button id="wbRefreshActivity" class="wb-btn wb-btn-small" type="button">Refresh GitHub</button>
      </div>
      <div class="wb-activity-grid">
        <div class="wb-activity-panel">
          <h3>Latest commits</h3>
          <div id="wbCommits" class="wb-activity-list"><div class="wb-loading">Loading GitHub…</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="wb-activity-panel">
          <h3>Open pull requests</h3>
          <div id="wbPrs" class="wb-activity-list"><div class="wb-loading">Loading GitHub…</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>

  <script>
    const boardEl = document.getElementById('wbBoard');
    const reposEl = document.getElementById('wbRepos');
    const searchEl = document.getElementById('wbSearch');
    const clearEl = document.getElementById('wbClear');
    const commitsEl = document.getElementById('wbCommits');
    const prsEl = document.getElementById('wbPrs');
    const refreshActivityEl = document.getElementById('wbRefreshActivity');
    const prefsKey = 'bndy-workboard-view-v2';

    let workboard = null;
    let viewPrefs = { lanes: {} };

    const el = (tag, className, text) => {
      const node = document.createElement(tag);
      if (className) node.className = className;
      if (text !== undefined) node.textContent = text;
      return node;
    };

    function repoUrl(repo) {
      if (!repo || !repo.startsWith('flowency-live/')) return null;
      return `https://github.com/${repo}`;
    }

    function loadPrefs() {
      try {
        const saved = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(prefsKey) || 'null');
        if (saved && saved.lanes) viewPrefs = saved;
      } catch (_) {}
    }

    function savePrefs() {
      try { localStorage.setItem(prefsKey, JSON.stringify(viewPrefs)); } catch (_) {}
    }

    function lanePrefs(id) {
      if (!viewPrefs.lanes[id]) {
        viewPrefs.lanes[id] = {
          expanded: true,
          columns: { now: false, next: false, done: false }
        };
      }
      const prefs = viewPrefs.lanes[id];
      prefs.columns ||= { now: false, next: false, done: false };
      return prefs;
    }

    function stateLabel(state) {
      return ({ live: 'LIVE', building: 'BUILDING', planned: 'PLANNED', legacy: 'LEGACY', decommissioned: 'DECOMMISSIONED' })[state] || String(state || 'UNKNOWN').toUpperCase();
    }

    function renderSummary(data) {
      document.getElementById('wbLaneCount').textContent = String(data.lanes.length);
      document.getElementById('wbProdRepoCount').textContent = String(data.repositories.filter(r => r.status === 'production').length);
      document.getElementById('wbRiskCount').textContent = String(data.lanes.filter(l => l.health === 'red' || l.health === 'amber').length);
      const d = new Date(data.updatedAt);
      document.getElementById('wbUpdated').textContent = Number.isNaN(d.getTime()) ? data.updatedAt : d.toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { day: '2-digit', month: 'short' });
    }

    function repoChip(repoId, repoMap) {
      const info = repoMap.get(repoId);
      const name = info ? info.repo.replace('flowency-live/', '') : repoId;
      const href = info ? repoUrl(info.repo) : null;
      const chip = href ? el('a', 'wb-repo-chip', name) : el('span', 'wb-repo-chip', name);
      if (href) {
        chip.href = href;
        chip.target = '_blank';
        chip.rel = 'noreferrer';
        chip.addEventListener('click', e => e.stopPropagation());
      }
      return chip;
    }

    function taskCard(task, column) {
      const card = el('article', `wb-task wb-task-${column}`);
      card.append(el('h4', '', task.title), el('p', '', task.detail));
      if (Array.isArray(task.evidence) && task.evidence.length) {
        const evidence = el('div', 'wb-evidence');
        task.evidence.forEach((href, idx) => {
          const a = el('a', '', `evidence ${idx + 1}`);
          a.href = href;
          a.target = '_blank';
          a.rel = 'noreferrer';
          evidence.appendChild(a);
        });
        card.appendChild(evidence);
      }
      return card;
    }

    function toggleLane(id) {
      const prefs = lanePrefs(id);
      prefs.expanded = !prefs.expanded;
      savePrefs();
      renderBoard(workboard, searchEl?.value || '');
    }

    function soloLane(id) {
      workboard.lanes.forEach(lane => { lanePrefs(lane.id).expanded = lane.id === id; });
      savePrefs();
      renderBoard(workboard, searchEl?.value || '');
    }

    function toggleLaneColumn(id, column) {
      const prefs = lanePrefs(id);
      prefs.columns[column] = !prefs.columns[column];
      savePrefs();
      renderBoard(workboard, searchEl?.value || '');
    }

    function taskColumn(lane, column, label) {
      const prefs = lanePrefs(lane.id);
      const items = lane[column] || [];
      const collapsed = !!prefs.columns[column];
      const wrap = el('section', `wb-column wb-column-${column}${collapsed ? ' is-collapsed' : ''}`);
      const head = el('button', 'wb-column-head');
      head.type = 'button';
      head.title = collapsed ? `Expand ${label}` : `Collapse ${label}`;
      head.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!collapsed));
      head.append(el('span', 'wb-column-title', label), el('span', 'wb-column-count', String(items.length)), el('span', 'wb-column-chevron', collapsed ? '＋' : '−'));
      head.addEventListener('click', () => toggleLaneColumn(lane.id, column));
      wrap.appendChild(head);

      if (!collapsed) {
        const content = el('div', 'wb-column-content');
        if (!items.length) content.appendChild(el('div', 'wb-empty', 'Nothing queued'));
        items.forEach(item => content.appendChild(taskCard(item, column)));
        wrap.appendChild(content);
      }
      return wrap;
    }

    function renderBoard(data, query = '') {
      const repoMap = new Map(data.repositories.map(r => [r.id, r]));
      const q = query.trim().toLowerCase();
      boardEl.replaceChildren();

      const filtered = data.lanes.filter(lane => {
        if (!q) return true;
        const haystack = [
          lane.title, lane.objective, lane.deliveryState, ...(lane.repos || []),
          ...lane.done.flatMap(x => [x.title, x.detail]),
          ...lane.now.flatMap(x => [x.title, x.detail]),
          ...lane.next.flatMap(x => [x.title, x.detail])
        ].join(' ').toLowerCase();
        return haystack.includes(q);
      });

      filtered.forEach(lane => {
        const prefs = lanePrefs(lane.id);
        const row = el('section', `wb-lane wb-delivery-${lane.deliveryState}${lane.targetState ? ' wb-is-target' : ''}${prefs.expanded ? '' : ' is-collapsed'}`);
        row.dataset.lane = lane.id;

        const head = el('div', 'wb-lane-head');
        head.tabIndex = 0;
        head.setAttribute('role', 'button');
        head.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(prefs.expanded));
        head.addEventListener('click', () => toggleLane(lane.id));
        head.addEventListener('keydown', e => {
          if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') { e.preventDefault(); toggleLane(lane.id); }
        });

        const toggle = el('span', 'wb-lane-toggle', prefs.expanded ? '−' : '+');
        const identity = el('div', 'wb-lane-copy');
        const stampRow = el('div', 'wb-stamp-row');
        stampRow.appendChild(el('span', `wb-stamp wb-state-${lane.deliveryState}`, stateLabel(lane.deliveryState)));
        if (lane.targetState) stampRow.appendChild(el('span', 'wb-stamp wb-stamp-target', 'TARGET STATE'));
        if (lane.health === 'red' || lane.health === 'amber') stampRow.appendChild(el('span', `wb-risk wb-risk-${lane.health}`, lane.health === 'red' ? 'CRITICAL GAP' : 'ATTENTION'));
        identity.append(stampRow, el('h3', '', lane.title), el('p', '', lane.objective));

        const chips = el('div', 'wb-repo-chips');
        (lane.repos || []).forEach(repoId => chips.appendChild(repoChip(repoId, repoMap)));
        identity.appendChild(chips);

        const counts = el('div', 'wb-lane-counts');
        counts.append(el('span', 'wb-count-now', `NOW ${lane.now.length}`), el('span', '', `TODO ${lane.next.length}`), el('span', '', `DONE ${lane.done.length}`));

        const actions = el('div', 'wb-lane-actions');
        const solo = el('button', 'wb-mini-btn', 'SOLO');
        solo.type = 'button';
        solo.title = 'Collapse every other swimlane';
        solo.addEventListener('click', e => { e.stopPropagation(); soloLane(lane.id); });
        actions.append(solo, counts);

        head.append(toggle, identity, actions);
        row.appendChild(head);

        if (prefs.expanded) {
          const body = el('div', 'wb-lane-body');
          const columns = ['now', 'next', 'done'];
          body.style.gridTemplateColumns = columns.map(c => prefs.columns[c] ? '48px' : 'minmax(240px, 1fr)').join(' ');
          body.append(taskColumn(lane, 'now', 'NOW'), taskColumn(lane, 'next', 'TODO / NEXT'), taskColumn(lane, 'done', 'DONE'));
          row.appendChild(body);
        }
        boardEl.appendChild(row);
      });

      if (!filtered.length) boardEl.appendChild(el('div', 'wb-loading', 'No workstreams match that filter.'));
      updateGlobalColumnButtons();
    }

    function setAllLanes(expanded) {
      workboard.lanes.forEach(lane => { lanePrefs(lane.id).expanded = expanded; });
      savePrefs();
      renderBoard(workboard, searchEl?.value || '');
    }

    function focusNow() {
      workboard.lanes.forEach(lane => {
        const prefs = lanePrefs(lane.id);
        prefs.expanded = true;
        prefs.columns.now = false;
        prefs.columns.next = true;
        prefs.columns.done = true;
      });
      savePrefs();
      renderBoard(workboard, searchEl?.value || '');
    }

    function toggleGlobalColumn(column) {
      const allCollapsed = workboard.lanes.every(lane => lanePrefs(lane.id).columns[column]);
      workboard.lanes.forEach(lane => { lanePrefs(lane.id).columns[column] = !allCollapsed; });
      savePrefs();
      renderBoard(workboard, searchEl?.value || '');
    }

    function updateGlobalColumnButtons() {
      if (!workboard) return;
      document.querySelectorAll('.wb-col-global').forEach(button => {
        const column = button.dataset.column;
        const allCollapsed = workboard.lanes.every(lane => lanePrefs(lane.id).columns[column]);
        button.classList.toggle('is-off', allCollapsed);
        button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(!allCollapsed));
      });
    }

    function resetView() {
      viewPrefs = { lanes: {} };
      savePrefs();
      renderBoard(workboard, searchEl?.value || '');
    }

    function renderRepos(data) {
      reposEl.replaceChildren();
      data.repositories.forEach(repo => {
        const card = el('article', 'wb-repo-card');
        const top = el('div', 'wb-repo-top');
        top.append(el('h3', '', repo.repo.replace('flowency-live/', '')), el('span', `wb-repo-status wb-repo-status-${repo.status}`, repo.status));
        card.append(top, el('div', 'wb-serves', repo.serves || ''), el('p', '', repo.role));
        const href = repoUrl(repo.repo);
        if (href) {
          card.tabIndex = 0;
          card.addEventListener('click', () => window.open(href, '_blank', 'noopener'));
          card.addEventListener('keydown', e => { if (e.key === 'Enter') window.open(href, '_blank', 'noopener'); });
        }
        reposEl.appendChild(card);
      });
    }

    async function loadBoard() {
      try {
        const res = await fetch('/workboard.json', { cache: 'no-store' });
        if (!res.ok) throw new Error(`workboard ${res.status}`);
        workboard = await res.json();
        loadPrefs();
        renderSummary(workboard);
        renderBoard(workboard);
        renderRepos(workboard);
        loadGithubActivity(false);
      } catch (error) {
        boardEl.replaceChildren(el('div', 'wb-error', 'Could not load workboard.json.'));
        console.error(error);
      }
    }

    function activityRow({ title, subtitle, href, meta }) {
      const row = el('a', 'wb-activity-row');
      row.href = href;
      row.target = '_blank';
      row.rel = 'noreferrer';
      const body = el('div', 'wb-activity-body');
      body.append(el('strong', '', title), el('span', '', subtitle));
      row.append(body, el('time', '', meta));
      return row;
    }

    function relativeTime(value) {
      const d = new Date(value);
      if (Number.isNaN(d.getTime())) return '';
      const mins = Math.max(0, Math.round((Date.now() - d.getTime()) / 60000));
      if (mins < 60) return `${mins}m`;
      const hours = Math.round(mins / 60);
      if (hours < 48) return `${hours}h`;
      return `${Math.round(hours / 24)}d`;
    }

    async function githubJson(url) {
      const res = await fetch(url, { headers: { 'Accept': 'application/vnd.github+json' } });
      if (!res.ok) throw new Error(`GitHub ${res.status}`);
      return res.json();
    }

    async function loadGithubActivity(force) {
      if (!workboard) return;
      refreshActivityEl.disabled = true;
      refreshActivityEl.textContent = 'Refreshing…';
      const cacheKey = 'bndy-workboard-github-v2';

      if (!force) {
        try {
          const cached = JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem(cacheKey) || 'null');
          if (cached && Date.now() - cached.savedAt < 300000) {
            renderActivity(cached.commits, cached.prs);
            refreshActivityEl.disabled = false;
            refreshActivityEl.textContent = 'Refresh GitHub';
            return;
          }
        } catch (_) {}
      }

      try {
        const commitRequests = workboard.activityRepos.map(async repo => {
          const data = await githubJson(`https://api.github.com/repos/${repo}/commits?per_page=1`);
          const c = data[0];
          if (!c) return null;
          return { repo, title: c.commit?.message?.split('\n')[0] || c.sha.slice(0, 7), date: c.commit?.committer?.date || c.commit?.author?.date, href: c.html_url };
        });
        const prRequest = githubJson('https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=org%3Aflowency-live+is%3Apr+is%3Aopen&sort=updated&order=desc&per_page=30');
        const settled = await Promise.allSettled(commitRequests);
        const commits = settled.filter(x => x.status === 'fulfilled' && x.value).map(x => x.value).sort((a, b) => new Date(b.date).getTime() - new Date(a.date).getTime()).slice(0, 12);
        const prData = await prRequest;
        const prs = (prData.items || []).filter(item => /\/bndy[^/]*\//i.test(item.repository_url + '/')).slice(0, 12).map(item => ({ title: item.title, repo: item.repository_url.split('/').pop(), number: item.number, updated: item.updated_at, href: item.html_url }));
        renderActivity(commits, prs);
        try { sessionStorage.setItem(cacheKey, JSON.stringify({ savedAt: Date.now(), commits, prs })); } catch (_) {}
      } catch (error) {
        commitsEl.replaceChildren(el('div', 'wb-error', 'GitHub activity is temporarily unavailable or rate-limited.'));
        prsEl.replaceChildren(el('div', 'wb-error', 'The structured backlog above is unaffected.'));
        console.error(error);
      } finally {
        refreshActivityEl.disabled = false;
        refreshActivityEl.textContent = 'Refresh GitHub';
      }
    }

    function renderActivity(commits, prs) {
      commitsEl.replaceChildren();
      prsEl.replaceChildren();
      if (!commits.length) commitsEl.appendChild(el('div', 'wb-empty', 'No recent commit data.'));
      commits.forEach(c => commitsEl.appendChild(activityRow({ title: c.title, subtitle: c.repo.replace('flowency-live/', ''), href: c.href, meta: relativeTime(c.date) })));
      if (!prs.length) prsEl.appendChild(el('div', 'wb-empty', 'No open BNDY pull requests.'));
      prs.forEach(pr => prsEl.appendChild(activityRow({ title: pr.title, subtitle: `${pr.repo} · PR #${pr.number}`, href: pr.href, meta: relativeTime(pr.updated) })));
    }

    searchEl?.addEventListener('input', () => workboard && renderBoard(workboard, searchEl.value));
    clearEl?.addEventListener('click', () => { if (searchEl) { searchEl.value = ''; renderBoard(workboard); searchEl.focus(); } });
    document.getElementById('wbExpandLanes')?.addEventListener('click', () => setAllLanes(true));
    document.getElementById('wbCollapseLanes')?.addEventListener('click', () => setAllLanes(false));
    document.getElementById('wbFocusNow')?.addEventListener('click', focusNow);
    document.getElementById('wbResetView')?.addEventListener('click', resetView);
    document.querySelectorAll('.wb-col-global').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => toggleGlobalColumn(button.dataset.column)));
    refreshActivityEl?.addEventListener('click', () => loadGithubActivity(true));

    loadBoard();
  </script>

  <style is:global>
    .wb-shell {
      --wb-panel:#111b2e; --wb-panel-2:#152238; --wb-border:rgba(255,255,255,.10); --wb-text:#f7f8fb; --wb-muted:#9eadc3;
      --wb-green:#39df91; --wb-amber:#ffb347; --wb-red:#ff5c6a; --wb-blue:#62a7ff; --wb-cyan:#46d7e8; --wb-target:#d78cff;
      color:var(--wb-text); background:radial-gradient(circle at 12% 0%,rgba(70,215,232,.08),transparent 28rem),radial-gradient(circle at 88% 10%,rgba(215,140,255,.06),transparent 32rem),#09111f;
      min-height:100vh; padding:5rem clamp(1rem,3vw,3rem) 7rem;
    }
    html[data-theme="light"] .wb-shell { --wb-panel:#fff; --wb-panel-2:#f7f9fc; --wb-border:rgba(15,23,41,.12); --wb-text:#0f1729; --wb-muted:#5a687d; background:#f3f5f8; }
    .wb-hero,.wb-section,.wb-architecture,.wb-summary { max-width:1600px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto; }
    .wb-hero { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; gap:2rem; margin-bottom:2rem; }
    .wb-kicker { font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; color:var(--wb-cyan); font-size:.72rem; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:.7rem; }
    .wb-hero h1 { font-family:'Inter Tight',sans-serif; font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,7.2rem); line-height:.86; letter-spacing:-.055em; margin:0; max-width:980px; }
    .wb-hero h1 span,.wb-muted { color:var(--wb-muted); }
    .wb-lede { max-width:760px; font-size:clamp(1rem,1.4vw,1.3rem); color:var(--wb-muted); margin:1.5rem 0 0; }
    .wb-hero-actions,.wb-tools,.wb-title-line,.wb-legend,.wb-stamp-row,.wb-repo-chips,.wb-viewbar,.wb-viewbar-group,.wb-lane-counts { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.6rem; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .wb-btn,.wb-view-btn,.wb-mini-btn { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; border:1px solid var(--wb-border); background:var(--wb-panel); color:var(--wb-text); text-decoration:none; font:600 .78rem 'Inter',sans-serif; cursor:pointer; border-radius:6px; }
